Text: 360° Stance Detection Sebastian Ruder, John Glover, Afshin Mehrabani, Parsa Ghaffari Aylien Ltd., Dublin, Ireland {sebastian,john,afshin,parsa}@aylien.com Abstract The proliferation of fake news and ﬁlter bub- bles makes it increasingly difﬁcult to form an arXiv:1804.00982v1 [cs.CL] 3 Apr 2018 unbiased, balanced opinion towards a topic. To ameliorate this, we propose 360° Stance Detection, a tool that aggregates news with multiple perspectives on a topic.

