Text: Science 376(12):86. William Ferreira and Andreas Vlachos. 2016. Emer- gent: a novel data-set for stance classiﬁcation. In Proceedings of the 2016 conference of the North American chapter of the association for computa- tional linguistics: Human language technologies. pages 1163–1168. Chuan Guo, Geoff Pleiss, Yu Sun, and Kilian Q. Wein- berger. 2017. On Calibration of Modern Neural Networks. Proceedings of ICML 2017 http:// arxiv.org/abs/1706.04599. Kazi Saidul Hasan and Vincent Ng.

Rank: 4
Source: 1804.00982.pdf
