Section: 4 Model
Text: The stance detection model is exposed as a web service and returns for each article-target entity pair a stance label (i.e. one of ‘in favour’, ‘against’ or ‘neutral’) along with a probability.6 The demo then visualizes the collected news ar- ticles as a 2D scatter plot with each (x,y) coordi- nate representing a single news article from a par- ticular outlet that matched the user query. The x- axis shows the stance of the article in the range [−1, 1].

